	(descr "Pololu D36V50F5 (item #4091) 5 V 5.5 A step-down, 25.4 mm square. Redrawn 2026-09-24 from Pololu's drill guide reg24d-drill.dxf and its labelled top-view photo: header rows 1.27 and 3.81 mm from the board edge, columns 6.35-19.05 mm, M2 holes 2.159 mm in from the edges, lone third hole beside the EN/PG end. Top view: pads 1/2 VOUT, 3-6 GND, 7/8 VIN, 9/10 VRP, 11 EN (outer row), 12 PG (inner row). Place flipped on B.Cu for an underside module mounted components-away (the natural way). The previous footprint had the lone hole at the VOUT end and the rows 0.48 mm off, which reversed the pinout when all three screws were fitted.")
